7-Zip WASM (server/src/fansubs/archive.ts, server/dist/7zz.wasm)
----------------------------------------------------------------

The server unpacks Anime Tosho's .xz subtitle tracks and 7z font packs with
7-Zip compiled to WebAssembly (the npm package 7z-wasm 1.2.0,
https://github.com/use-strict/7z-wasm, based on 7-Zip 24.09). The bundle
copies 7zz.wasm next to server.mjs and the image ships it. From the package's
License.txt:

